1001:     Bit Notation
1002: 
1003:     Multiple-bit fields can include contiguous and noncontiguous bits contained
1004:     in angle brackets ( <> ). Multiple contiguous bits are indicated by a pair of
1005:     numbers separated by a colon ( : ). For example, <9:7,5,2:0> specifies bits
